[TITLE]
FILE-18: rules close P1 and P2 one second after 8:00 and 9:00; P3 stays open

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   100   300

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   200

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  1000    8     100    0      Open
 P2  R1  J1  1000    8     100    0      Open
 P3  R1  J1  1000    8     100    0      Open

[RULES]
RULE TIMED
IF SYSTEM TIME >= 8:00:01                ; 28,801 s after the start
THEN PIPE P1 STATUS IS CLOSED

RULE CLOCK
IF SYSTEM CLOCKTIME >= 9:00:01 AM        ; 32,401 s (the run starts at 12 AM)
THEN PIPE P2 STATUS IS CLOSED

[TIMES]
 Duration            12:00
 Hydraulic Timestep  1:00
 Rule Timestep       0:06              ; rules are checked every 360 s

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
